[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/321541181","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/321541181/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/321541181/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/11.0.0","id":321541181,"author":{"login":"disassembler","id":651205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTIwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/651205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler","html_url":"https://github.com/disassembler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4TKlQ9","tag_name":"11.0.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Daedalus 11.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-05-12T18:15:40Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T15:37:45Z","published_at":"2026-05-13T15:37:45Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/11.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/11.0.0","body":"## What's new\r\n\r\n### Van Rossem Hard Fork support\r\n\r\nDaedalus 11.0.0 adds support for the Van Rossem Hard Fork (Protocol Version 11). **Updating before the fork is required to maintain network compatibility.**\r\n\r\n> **Note on versioning:** Starting with this release, Daedalus major versions align with the bundled `cardano-node` major version. Daedalus 8.0.0 was the last release under the previous scheme; versions 9 and 10 were skipped.\r\n\r\n## Dependency upgrades\r\n\r\n- `cardano-node` updated to **11.0.1**.\r\n- `cardano-wallet` updated to **v2026-05-11**.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended that all Daedalus users upgrade to this version.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: [CHANGELOG.md](./CHANGELOG.md)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<a name=\"japanese\"></a>\r\n\r\n## 新機能・変更点\r\n\r\n### Van Rossem ハードフォーク対応\r\n\r\nDaedalus 11.0.0 は、Van Rossem ハードフォーク（プロトコルバージョン 11）に対応しました。**ネットワークとの互換性を維持するため、フォーク実施前のアップデートが必要です。**\r\n\r\n> **バージョン番号に関するご注意：** 本リリースより、Daedalus のメジャーバージョンは同梱の `cardano-node` のメジャーバージョンに準じます。Daedalus 8.0.0 が旧スキームでの最終リリースとなり、バージョン 9 および 10 はスキップされています。\r\n\r\n## 依存関係のアップグレード\r\n\r\n- `cardano-node` を **11.0.1** に更新。\r\n- `cardano-wallet` を **v2026-05-11** に更新。\r\n\r\nすべての Daedalus ユーザーに、このバージョンへの更新を推奨します。\r\n\r\n**完全な変更履歴**：[CHANGELOG.md](./CHANGELOG.md)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/314703882","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/314703882/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/314703882/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/8.0.0","id":314703882,"author":{"login":"disassembler","id":651205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTIwNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/651205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler","html_url":"https://github.com/disassembler","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/disassembler/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4SwgAK","tag_name":"8.0.0","target_commitish":"master","name":"Daedalus 8.0.0","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-04-27T14:39:14Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T11:28:58Z","published_at":"2026-04-28T16:17:34Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/8.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/8.0.0","body":"## What's new\r\n\r\n### Reduced memory usage with LSM UTxO backend\r\n\r\nDaedalus now uses the LSM (Log-Structured Merge-tree) UTxO on-disk backend, which significantly reduces the memory required to run a full node. This makes Daedalus more accessible on machines with limited RAM.\r\n\r\n### Faster sync from scratch with Mithril bootstrap\r\n\r\nFresh installations now benefit from Mithril bootstrapping, which dramatically speeds up initial chain synchronisation by downloading and restoring a full snapshot rather than replaying the entire chain. Note: partial sync resumption via Mithril will be addressed in a future release.\r\n\r\n### Native Apple Silicon installer\r\n\r\nOn Apple Silicon hardware (M1/M2/M3), Daedalus now automatically selects the native `darwin-arm` installer, providing better performance and compatibility compared to the Rosetta-translated version.\r\n\r\n## Bug fixes\r\n\r\n- Fixed ledger replay progress being stuck at 0.00%, caused by a timestamp format change in cardano-tracer logs.\r\n- Fixed an IPC issue where `shell.openPath` errors were not surfaced correctly.\r\n- Fixed an installer issue where `checkpoints.json` was omitted for non-mainnet clusters (e.g. preview).\r\n- Fixed node configuration to enforce `PraosMode`, overriding incorrect upstream defaults.\r\n\r\n## Dependency upgrades\r\n\r\n- `cardano-node` updated to **10.7.1**.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended that all Daedalus users upgrade to this version.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: [CHANGELOG.md](./CHANGELOG.md)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<a name=\"japanese\"></a>\r\n\r\n## 新機能・改善点\r\n\r\n### LSM UTxO バックエンドによるメモリ使用量の削減\r\nDaedalus は LSM（Log-Structured Merge-tree）UTxO オンディスクバックエンドを採用しました。これにより、フルノードの実行に必要なメモリが大幅に削減され、RAM の少ないマシンでも Daedalus をより快適にご利用いただけるようになります。\r\n\r\n### Mithril ブートストラップによる初回同期の高速化\r\n新規インストール時に Mithril ブートストラップが適用されるようになりました。チェーン全体を再生する代わりに、完全なスナップショットをダウンロード・復元することで、初回チェーン同期を大幅に短縮します。なお、Mithril による部分同期の再開については、将来のリリースで対応予定です。\r\n\r\n### Apple Silicon ネイティブインストーラー\r\nApple Silicon 搭載ハードウェア（M1/M2/M3）において、Daedalus はネイティブの darwin-arm インストーラーを自動的に選択するようになりました。Rosetta 変換版と比較して、パフォーマンスと互換性が向上します。\r\n\r\n## バグ修正\r\n\r\n- `cardano-tracer` ログのタイムスタンプ形式変更に起因する、台帳リプレイの進捗が 0.00% で停止する問題を修正しました。\r\n- `shell.openPath` のエラーが正しく表示されない IPC の問題を修正しました。\r\n- メインネット以外のクラスター（例：preview）で `checkpoints.json` が欠落するインストーラーの問題を修正しました。\r\n- 不正なアップストリームのデフォルト設定を上書きし、`PraosMode` を強制するようノード設定を修正しました。\r\n\r\n\r\n## 依存関係のアップグレード\r\n\r\n- `cardano-node` を `10.7.1` に更新しました。\r\n\r\n\r\nすべての Daedalus ユーザーに、本バージョンへのアップグレードを推奨します。\r\n**完全な変更履歴**：[CHANGELOG.md](http://changelog.md/)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/243443686","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/243443686/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/243443686/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/7.2.0","id":243443686,"author":{"login":"michalrus","id":4366292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/michalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4Ogqfm","tag_name":"7.2.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 7.2.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2025-08-29T10:56:45Z","updated_at":"2025-08-29T11:01:35Z","published_at":"2025-08-29T11:01:14Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/7.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/7.2.0","body":"Daedalus 7.2.0 is a mainnet release that updates links to the new proposal portal from IdeaScale to Project Catalyst.\r\n\r\nSimultaneously, we're upgrading to node [v.10.2.1](https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/10.2.1) and cardano-wallet v2025-03-31 to ensure efficiency and compatibility.\r\n\r\nThis version also fixes an error that occurred when changing the display currency in ‘Settings → Wallets’. Users can now change their display currency without interruption.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended that all Daedalus users upgrade to this version.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/compare/7.1.0...7.2.0"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/202592194","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/202592194/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/202592194/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/7.1.0","id":202592194,"author":{"login":"michalrus","id":4366292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/michalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4ME0_C","tag_name":"7.1.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 7.1.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2025-02-26T16:13:02Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T16:15:31Z","published_at":"2025-02-26T16:15:31Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/7.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/7.1.0","body":"Daedalus 7.1.0 is a **security and maintenance update** that ensures compatibility with the **Plomin Hard Fork** while improving performance and stability.\r\n\r\n### Key Updates & Fixes\r\n\r\n#### Security & Stability Improvements\r\n\r\n* Updated **cardano-node to 10.1.4** and **cardano-wallet to v2025-01-09** to mitigate a potential **DoS attack** following the **Plomin Hard Fork (Protocol Version 10)**.\r\n\r\n#### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* **CIP-129 DRep ID Support** – Ensures full compatibility with new on-chain governance features.\r\n\r\n* **macOS Compatibility Fix** – Resolved dynamic library loading issue affecting older macOS versions (10.15.x).\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/43885605379865) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/202592194/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/190486486","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/190486486/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/190486486/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/7.0.2","id":190486486,"author":{"login":"michalrus","id":4366292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/michalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4LWpfW","tag_name":"7.0.2","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 7.0.2 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-12-12T17:21:53Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T12:13:11Z","published_at":"2024-12-12T17:23:53Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/7.0.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/7.0.2","body":"Daedalus 7.0.2 enables users to delegate their voting power to delegated representatives (DReps) or choose an automatic voting option (abstain or no confidence), ensuring that the Daedalus community has a voice in the success of Cardano.\r\n\r\nIn the new voting tab, users can select their registration preference for each wallet held in Daedalus. See the [Cardano Governance documentation](https://docs.intersectmbo.org/cardano/cardano-governance/overview) to learn more.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/41138636940825) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/190240638","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/190240638/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/190240638/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/7.0.1","id":190240638,"author":{"login":"michalrus","id":4366292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/michalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4LVtd-","tag_name":"7.0.1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 7.0.1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-12-11T15:54:36Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T12:13:36Z","published_at":"2024-12-11T15:56:00Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/7.0.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/7.0.1","body":"Daedalus 7.0.1 enables users to delegate their voting power to delegated representatives (DReps) or choose an automatic voting option (abstain or no confidence), ensuring that the Daedalus community has a voice in the success of Cardano.\r\n\r\nIn the new voting tab, users can select their registration preference for each wallet held in Daedalus. See the [Cardano Governance documentation](https://docs.intersectmbo.org/cardano/cardano-governance/overview) to learn more.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/41075414043801) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/189947058","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/189947058/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/189947058/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/7.0.0","id":189947058,"author":{"login":"michalrus","id":4366292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNjYyOTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4366292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus","html_url":"https://github.com/michalrus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michalrus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4LUlyy","tag_name":"7.0.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 7.0.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-12-10T12:30:42Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T12:41:15Z","published_at":"2024-12-10T12:41:15Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/7.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/7.0.0","body":"Daedalus 7.0.0 enables users to delegate their voting power to delegated representatives (DReps) or choose an automatic voting option (abstain or no confidence), ensuring that the Daedalus community has a voice in the success of Cardano.\r\n\r\nIn the new voting tab, users can select their registration preference for each wallet held in Daedalus. See the [Cardano Governance documentation](https://docs.intersectmbo.org/cardano/cardano-governance/overview) to learn more.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/40968665483929) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/178436155","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/178436155/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/178436155/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/6.0.2","id":178436155,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4Korg7","tag_name":"6.0.2","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 6.0.2 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-10-04T12:47:14Z","updated_at":"2024-10-04T15:39:53Z","published_at":"2024-10-04T15:39:53Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/6.0.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/6.0.2","body":"Daedalus 6.0.2 is a mainnet release that makes a few small but important changes to Daedalus.\r\n\r\n1. Project Catalyst’s Fund13 voting threshold is changing from 450 ADA to 25 ADA, so Daedalus now reflects this change. \r\n2. [Bug Fix] Addressed a misconfiguration with the token metadata.\r\n3. [Bug Fix] Auto-updater on Linux works as expected on all networks (preview, preprod, mainnet).\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/38432234574617) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/178436155/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/173243277","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/173243277/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/173243277/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/6.0.1","id":173243277,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4KU3uN","tag_name":"6.0.1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 6.0.1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-09-03T11:43:33Z","updated_at":"2024-09-03T15:27:04Z","published_at":"2024-09-03T15:27:04Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/6.0.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/6.0.1","body":"Daedalus 6.0.1 is a mainnet release upgrading to node [9.1.1](https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/9.1.1) to fix the ledger replay issue in the Conway era reported [here](https://discord.com/channels/826816523368005654/862918105835110400/1279955818669674537).\r\nThis release prevents nodes replaying from genesis, and instead replay as normal. It is mandatory for all Daedalus users to upgrade to this version.\r\n\r\nIf you have already experienced this issue, your Daedalus will likely replay the ledger state from genesis (0%), so you may see longer synchronization times.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/37188014124697) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/171039192","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/171039192/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/171039192/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/6.0.0","id":171039192,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4KMdnY","tag_name":"6.0.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 6.0.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-08-20T10:20:01Z","updated_at":"2024-08-20T10:45:30Z","published_at":"2024-08-20T10:45:30Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/6.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/6.0.0","body":"Daedalus 6.0.0 is a mainnet release required to cross the upcoming Chang hard fork and operate in the Conway era. It is mandatory for all Daedalus users to upgrade to this version.\r\n\r\nThis version upgrades to node [9.1.0](https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/9.1.0), Cardano wallet [v2024-07-27](https://github.com/cardano-foundation/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2024-07-27), the dependent Ledger and Trezor hardware wallet libraries, and fixes the Daedalus auto-update feature to resolve the issue when running Daedalus on Linux with enabled AppArmor reported [here](https://forum.cardano.org/t/installing-daedalus-5-3-1-66691-mainnet-f14275aa5-x86-64-linux-bin-with-permission-denied-ubuntu-24-04/131709).\r\n\r\nSince this release replays the ledger state from scratch (0%), users may experience longer synchronization times.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/36568246873241) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/168239639","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/168239639/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/168239639/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.5.0","id":168239639,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4KByIX","tag_name":"5.5.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.5.0 Preview update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":true,"created_at":"2024-08-01T12:47:55Z","updated_at":"2024-08-01T13:04:54Z","published_at":"2024-08-01T13:04:42Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.5.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.5.0","body":"Daedalus 5.5.0 is a testnet-only release to test the upcoming Chang hard fork on `Preview` testnet. This version upgrades to node [9.1.0](https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/9.1.0), Cardano wallet [v2024-07-27](https://github.com/cardano-foundation/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2024-07-27), and fixes the Daedalus auto-update feature to resolve the issue when running Daedalus on Linux with enabled AppArmor reported [here](https://forum.cardano.org/t/installing-daedalus-5-3-1-66691-mainnet-f14275aa5-x86-64-linux-bin-with-permission-denied-ubuntu-24-04/131709).\r\n\r\nSince this release replays the ledger state from scratch (0%), users will experience longer synchronization times.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER: This testnet-only release is for testing purposes only and is provided “AS IS” and under [Apache 2.0 license](https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/blob/develop/LICENSE). It may not be fully featured and may contain bugs. Use at your own risk. Also, Ledger and Trezor hardware wallet support may not work properly or at all, especially if you are on the latest Ledger or Trezor versions.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/35764730116633) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/160471531","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/160471531/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/160471531/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.4.0","id":160471531,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4JkJnr","tag_name":"5.4.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.4.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-06-14T10:31:30Z","updated_at":"2024-06-14T11:24:55Z","published_at":"2024-06-14T11:24:55Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.4.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.4.0","body":"The Daedalus 5.4.0 release upgrades to node [8.9.2](https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/8.9.2) and Cardano wallet [v2024-05-05](https://github.com/cardano-foundation/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2024-05-05) and resolves the issue of empty logs.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/33695971091097) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Mainnet at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus for Preview and Pre-prod testnets at [docs.cardano.org](https://docs.cardano.org/cardano-testnets/tools/daedalus-testnet/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/156233615","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/156233615/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/156233615/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.3.1","id":156233615,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4JT--P","tag_name":"5.3.1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.3.1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2024-05-17T08:57:53Z","updated_at":"2024-05-17T09:44:43Z","published_at":"2024-05-17T09:44:43Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.3.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.3.1","body":"The Daedalus 5.3.1 mainnet release upgrades node [1.35.5](https://github.com/IntersectMBO/cardano-node/releases/tag/1.35.5) to address ledger synchronization issues.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/32506884750873) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/113075581","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/113075581/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/113075581/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.3.0","id":113075581,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4GvWV9","tag_name":"5.3.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.3.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-07-20T20:02:02Z","updated_at":"2023-07-21T15:04:46Z","published_at":"2023-07-21T15:04:46Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.3.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.3.0","body":"The Daedalus 5.3.0 Mainnet release supports the new Catalyst registration process, which requires registering with a regular payment address (and not with staking rewards address).\r\n\r\nIf you participated in previous voting and wish to participate in Fund 10, please ensure you register again with Daedalus 5.3.0, since old registration formats will not be eligible for voting rewards.\r\n\r\nThe update improves the stability of the exchange rate conversion feature. It also makes the syncing progress percentage formatting more consistent. \r\n\r\nThis update brings in numerous dependency updates - [cardano-wallet 2023-04-14](https://github.com/cardano-foundation/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2023-04-14), [Electron 24.2](https://github.com/electron/electron/releases/tag/v24.2.0), Node.js 18.14.0, trezor-connect 9.0.8, [Cardano Ledger JS app 6.0.0](https://github.com/cardano-foundation/ledgerjs-hw-app-cardano/releases/tag/v6.0.0).\r\n\r\nThe PGP (GPG) key used to sign releases has been changed from:\r\n `D325 87D4 090F E461 CAEE 0FF4 966E 5CB9 CBFA A9BA`\r\nto\r\n`53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`, please see the updated [verification instructions](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360038792814).\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/20421748935065) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `53D0 FA8D A2B8 D1FF 4975 AECB F99D 6C70 C2B3 FB43`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/53D0FA8DA2B8D1FF4975AECBF99D6C70C2B3FB43\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/89219051","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/89219051/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/89219051/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.2.0","id":89219051,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4FUV_r","tag_name":"5.2.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.2.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2023-01-17T09:53:57Z","updated_at":"2023-01-17T10:27:29Z","published_at":"2023-01-17T10:27:29Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.2.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.2.0","body":"The Daedalus 5.2.0 Mainnet release supports Cardano node version [1.35.4](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-node/releases/tag/1.35.4) and Cardano wallet version [2022.12.14](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2022-12-14).\r\nThis release also updates the Catalyst API URL to point to a new URL.\r\nAdditionally, this update adds Byron wallet tracking capability and aggregates similar RAM sizes for easier data analysis.\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/14431962342553) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/82104840","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/82104840/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/82104840/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.1.1","id":82104840,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4E5NII","tag_name":"5.1.1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.1.1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-11-04T14:11:58Z","updated_at":"2022-11-04T16:15:15Z","published_at":"2022-11-04T16:15:15Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.1.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.1.1","body":"Daedalus mainnet 5.1.1 increases the minimum required free disk space for running a fully synced Daedalus wallet from 2GB to 4GB.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/12074707538713) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github).\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/79932947","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/79932947/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/79932947/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.1.0","id":79932947,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4Ew64T","tag_name":"5.1.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.1.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-10-14T08:55:46Z","updated_at":"2022-10-14T15:15:02Z","published_at":"2022-10-14T15:15:02Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.1.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.1.0","body":"Daedalus mainnet 5.1.0 brings two updates to the hardware wallet integration. An updated LedgerJS package including the upcoming Ledger Cardano App 5.0.0 and Babbage support, and Trezor Connect update to version 9.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this release integrates [cardano-wallet v2022-10-06](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2022-10-06) which is compatible with the Babbage era and fixes the fee calculation performance deterioration.\r\n\r\nThis update also introduces an optional anonymous usage data analytics collection that will help the team to prioritize new features and bug fixing.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/11204361405849) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA\r\n\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/76973032","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/76973032/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/76973032/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/5.0.0","id":76973032,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4EloPo","tag_name":"5.0.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 5.0.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-09-12T07:39:06Z","updated_at":"2022-09-13T08:03:12Z","published_at":"2022-09-13T08:03:12Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/5.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/5.0.0","body":"Daedalus 5.0.0 Mainnet  release supports node version [1.35.3](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-node/releases/tag/1.35.3) and is Vasil compatible.\r\n\r\nThis release also fixes the following known issues: \r\n\r\n* Older Daedalus executables that didn’t get deleted after auto update\r\n* Errors when selecting syncing wallets during delegation/redeem ITN rewards process\r\n* System using previous amount of tokens to be sent even if user alters the amount during fee calculation\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this release replaces the darwin-launcher.go process image with cardano-launcher.\r\n\r\nThe “Terms of Service” have also been updated.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/10279881048985) for more information.\r\n\r\nDownload Daedalus at [daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/76973032/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/69157422","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/69157422/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/69157422/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.11.0","id":69157422,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4EH0Iu","tag_name":"4.11.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.11.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-06-10T13:01:20Z","updated_at":"2022-06-10T13:43:43Z","published_at":"2022-06-10T13:43:43Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.11.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.11.0","body":"Daedalus 4.11.0 adds support for Ledger Nano S Plus and Trezor firmware 2.5.1.\r\nThis release also fixes two known issues with Trezor: first-time delegating using Trezor firmware 2.4.3, and pairing with Trezor Model T if a wrong passphrase is inserted while verifying an address.\r\nThis version also improves the messaging for insufficient funds, supports native Apple Silicon chip, (although it is not ready for distribution yet), and lays the foundation for future support of this chipset.\r\n\r\n### Introducing Lace 1.0, the new light wallet platform from Input Output\r\n\r\nManage your digital assets, view and send Cardano NFTs and connect to marketplaces. Stake your funds and connect to DApps, all from one easy-to-use, welcoming platform.\r\n[Register now](https://hubs.li/Q01d2lg60) to stay up-to-date with the upcoming Lace 1.0 launch and follow [@lace_io](https://twitter.com/lace_io) on Twitter for all the latest updates.\r\nPlus, stay tuned for a Lace exclusive at the Cardano Community event and Consensus 2022.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/7330921186201) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/66783184","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/66783184/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/66783184/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.10.0","id":66783184,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4D-wfQ","tag_name":"4.10.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.10.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-05-13T09:41:48Z","updated_at":"2022-05-13T10:45:32Z","published_at":"2022-05-13T10:45:32Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.10.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.10.0","body":"Daedalus 4.10.0 fixes a pairing issue for Ledger Nano S on Windows, improves the display of unnamed native tokens, and enables support for the Windows development environment.\r\nThis version also integrates the latest version of [cardano-wallet](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2022-04-27) (which supports [Cardano node 1.34.1](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-node/releases/tag/1.34.1)) and includes several bug fixes and user interface improvements.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/6515425656089) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/64331017","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/64331017/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/64331017/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.9.1","id":64331017,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4D1Z0J","tag_name":"4.9.1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.9.1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-04-11T19:48:38Z","updated_at":"2022-04-13T07:34:16Z","published_at":"2022-04-13T07:34:16Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.9.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.9.1","body":"Daedalus 4.9.1 is a maintenance release that upgrades LedgerJs to the latest version (5.0).\r\nThis release also fixes an issue where new macOS users received a warning in the installation process.\r\nLastly, it fixes the incorrect display of a Fund number on the Catalyst screen.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/5532611987609) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/61172947","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/61172947/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/61172947/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.9.0","id":61172947,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4DpWzT","tag_name":"4.9.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.9.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-03-07T12:19:03Z","updated_at":"2022-03-07T16:47:37Z","published_at":"2022-03-07T16:47:37Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.9.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.9.0","body":"Daedalus 4.9.0 improves feedback on the node syncing stages, updates the Send screen, the Stake Pools list view, and the wallets menu.\r\nThe sync screen now displays detailed information about all the node syncing stages.\r\nThe Send screen automatically updates the minimum ada required to process a transaction and includes a new dialog for selecting tokens.\r\nThe delegated stake pools are now displayed in the Stake Pools list view.\r\nThe wallets menu now includes search and sort features.\r\nThis release also brings several other user interface improvements, including:\r\n- A Windows 11 issue that prevented checking the disk space has been fixed.\r\n- The Daedalus Team screen has been updated and the Daedalus codebase has been migrated to Typescript.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4579419674777) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/59348000","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/59348000/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/59348000/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.9.0-FC1","id":59348000,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4DiZQg","tag_name":"4.9.0-FC1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.9.0-FC1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-02-11T16:06:28Z","updated_at":"2022-02-11T16:16:30Z","published_at":"2022-02-11T16:16:30Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.9.0-FC1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.9.0-FC1","body":"This Daedalus Flight release brings improvements to the Send screen, which now automatically updates the minimum ada required for a transaction, and includes a new dialog for the selection of tokens to be sent. In addition, delegated stake pools are now displayed in the Stake pools list view.\r\nThe wallets menu has been updated to include search and sort features. This release also brings several other user interface adjustments.\r\nA Windows 11 issue that prevented checking the disk space has also been fixed. The Daedalus Team screen has been updated and the Daedalus codebase was migrated to Typescript.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4418387854105) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/flight/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/58669489","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/58669489/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/58669489/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.8.0","id":58669489,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4Dfzmx","tag_name":"4.8.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.8.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-02-03T17:13:40Z","updated_at":"2022-02-04T09:02:46Z","published_at":"2022-02-04T09:02:46Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.8.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.8.0","body":"**Note: This version requires a complete node re-sync which could take several hours**\r\nThis Daedalus release integrates the latest version of [cardano-wallet](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-wallet/releases/tag/v2022-01-18), which supports [Cardano node v1.33.0](https://github.com/input-output-hk/cardano-node/releases/tag/1.33.0). This latest Cardano node version brings a significant performance improvement. \r\nFor computers with less than 16GB of RAM, a new splash screen is displayed, with an option to enable an alternative configuration of the Cardano node runtime system ([RTS](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4415304990745)), which can reduce memory usage, and a reminder about the recommended hardware requirements for Daedalus.\r\nThis version also includes minor fixes and user interface improvements.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4416804490393) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/58669489/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/57812235","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/57812235/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/57812235/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.8.0-FC1","id":57812235,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4DciUL","tag_name":"4.8.0-FC1","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.8.0-FC1 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2022-01-24T09:41:35Z","updated_at":"2022-01-24T09:49:17Z","published_at":"2022-01-24T09:49:17Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.8.0-FC1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.8.0-FC1","body":"This Daedalus Flight release integrates the latest version of cardano-wallet, which supports  Cardano node v1.33.0. The latest Cardano node version requires a full re-sync and brings a significant performance improvement. It also enables the Cardano node runtime system ([RTS](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4415304990745)), which can reduce memory usage on computers with less than 16GB of RAM.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4415380255641) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/flight/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/57308294","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/57308294/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/57308294/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/