luswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/55253565","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/55253565/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/55253565/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.6.0","id":55253565,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4DSxo9","tag_name":"4.6.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.6.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2021-12-13T08:58:56Z","updated_at":"2021-12-14T09:05:00Z","published_at":"2021-12-14T09:05:00Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/tarball/4.6.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/zipball/4.6.0","body":"This release of Daedalus integrates the latest version of cardano-wallet, which fixes an issue where the wallet would sometimes disappear. It also includes a new discreet mode that hides sensitive information, new messages in the startup and shutdown screens, and updates to the Catalyst screen for the remaining Fund7 phases. The automatic system update has been improved to support platform-specific updates. This release also includes minor user interface and internal improvements as well as integration with the latest cardano-launcher version.\r\n\r\nPlease read the [release notes](https://iohk.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4411930212761) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/54142436","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/54142436/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/54142436/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.5.2","id":54142436,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/f