/en-us/articles/4409944350489) for more information.\r\n\r\n[Download Daedalus at daedaluswallet.io](https://daedaluswallet.io/en/download/?utm_source=github&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=github)\r\n\r\n## Installer integrity verification\r\n\r\n### PGP signatures\r\n\r\nInstallers are signed with IOHK's organisational PGP key with this fingerprint: `D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA`.\r\nhttps://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/D32587D4090FE461CAEE0FF4966E5CB9CBFAA9BA"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/53705882","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/53705882/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/53705882/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/input-output-hk/daedalus/releases/tag/4.5.0","id":53705882,"author":{"login":"LaurenceIO","id":73659683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjU5Njgz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73659683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO","html_url":"https://github.com/LaurenceIO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LaurenceIO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOBC0avM4DM3ya","tag_name":"4.5.0","target_commitish":"develop","name":"Daedalus 4.5.0 update","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"crea